  "description": "Filter Power Automate flow runs by date and trigger parameters, and open any run directly in your browser. Download the run's JSON, where 'Apply to each' loops are sequentially numbered, so you can search for a loop in the web interface and jump straight to the exact iteration you need. The tool also follows calls to child flows, letting you navigate directly to the child flow's run - no more digging through run histories across multiple flows.",
